---
source: crates/psptool-cli/tests/help.rs
expression: "render_help(&[\"extract\", \"--help\"])"
---
Extract one or more entry bodies

Usage: psptool extract [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  

Options:
  -r, --rom-index <ROM_INDEX>              [default: 0]
  -d, --directory-index <DIRECTORY_INDEX>  
  -e, --file-index <FILE_INDEX>            
  -T, --type-regex <TYPE_REGEX>            
  -o, --outfile <OUTFILE>                  
  -u, --decompress                         
  -c, --decrypt                            
  -k, --pem-key                            
  -n, --no-duplicates                      
  -h, --help                               Print help
